{
  "slug": "tres-finance-plugin",
  "name": "Tres Finance Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The first official TRES Finance plugin for Claude Code — blockchain accounting workflows, ledger management, and transaction analysis. Connects to the hosted TRES Finance MCP server; collects no usage telemetry. Privacy: https://tres.finance/privacy-policy/",
  "longDescription": "Ships **22 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (22): `tres-asc845-swap-reprice-skill` (Reprice swap transaction legs under ASC 845 (Nonmonetary Transactions) to ensure clearing accounts net to zero), `tres-asset-balance-validation` (Validate wallet balances in TRES Finance against DeBank and generate a discrepancy report), `tres-cost-basis` (Manage cost basis calculation in TRES Finance: check status, view/change strategy (FIFO, LIFO, AVG, MAX_GAINS, MAX_LOSSES, FIFO_IMPAIRMENT), trigger…), `tres-data-collection-commit` (Trigger on-chain data collection (a \"Commit\") in Tres Finance for wallets that have already been onboarded), `tres-erp-rule-suggestions` (Guide users through creating ERP accounting rules for crypto organizations on the Tres Finance platform), `tres-explorer-tx-to-ledger` (Add a blockchain explorer transaction to the TRES Finance ledger), `tres-export-3rd-party-contacts` (Extract all 3rd-party (non-owned) addresses from a TRES Finance environment and export them as an XLSX workbook to…), `tres-import-contacts` (Import contacts (address book entries) into TRES Finance from a CSV or XLSX file), and 14 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `TRES Finance`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tres-finance-plugin@claude-community` from `anthropics/claude-plugins-community` (`tres-finance-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 22,
    "mcp": 1
  },
